          "text": "{\"regions\":{\"r2\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"stellation of that name\u2014a hundred physicians ) and is the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"crest-ornament of S'iva\u2019s head, consumption does not leave\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"the Moon: or by whom can the ordinance of cruel Fate be\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"transgressed ?\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r3\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"97. That, which is fixed as a man\u2019s portion in this world\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"by all-powerful Destiny, will go to him; patronage of the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"great ( lit. great patronage ) is not at all the cause ( of the\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"acquisition ). Although the cloud, the gratifier of the desires\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"of all beings, showers daily, only two or three minute drops\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"of water fall into the mouth of the ch\u00e2taka.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r4\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"98. When on the branch of the karira tree there is not a\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"single leaf, it is not the fault of the spring. If the owl cannot\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"see by day what blame is due to the sun ? Showers of rain\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"do not fall into the mouth of the ch\u00e2taka; but why blame\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"the cloud for that ? Who is able to wipe off what has\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"once been written on the forehead by fate ?\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r5\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"99. We shall bow to the gods, but then, even they are\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"subject to the accursed fate; (in that case) fate ought to re-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"ceive our homage; but even fate dispenses but the fruits con-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"sistent with each action. The fruit being dependent on action,\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"what (have we to do) with the gods and what with fate ! Bow\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"to those Karmans then, which even fate cannot control.\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r6\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"100. A bow to that Karman by whom Brahm\u00e2 was\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"confined in the interior of the pot-like primordial egg ( there\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"to evolve his creation) like a potter; by whom Vishnu was\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"hurled into the very troublesome intricacy of the ten incar-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"nations; by whom S'iva has been compelled to wander for\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"alms skull in hand; and in obedience to whom the sun ever\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":8,\"text\":\"roams in the sky.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":true,\"note\":\"Several words at the left edge are obscured by print damage.\"},\"r7\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"101. A handsome form avails not; neither does descent\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"nor character; not even learning, nor service assiduously\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":true,\"note\":\"The first word of line 2 is obscured.\"},\"r1\":{\"type\":\"page_number\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"[ 18 ]\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null}},\"units\":[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"type\":\"translation\",\"number\":null,\"label\":null,\"open_start